1688               /
1689               /       VEELIM IS THE SCALING ROUTINE FOR VELOCITY COMPONENTS.
1690               /       THE COMPONENTS ARE SCALED TO REMAIN IN THE RANGE 140
1691               /       TO -140.  THIS IS NECESSARY TO AVOID ASTRONOMICAL SPPED
1692               /       BUILDUP ON THE SMALL SCREEN.  UNFORTUNATELY THE X AND Y
1693               /       COMPONENTS ARE SCALED SEPARATELY WHICH GIVES SLIGHT BUT
1694               /       NOTICABLE DISTORTIONS IN DIAGONAL FLIGHT PATHS.  IN THE
1695               /       NORMAL HEAT OF THE BATTLE NO ONE WILL REALLY NOTICE.
1696               /
